"News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump welcomes China's Xi for high-stakes summit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d2b47ae4078f192212894166d13f3818aa05355c7f4c3886c04da72a60d416c2</id><updated>2026-09-24T05:04:55Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T22:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-welcomes-china-s-xi-for-high-stakes-summit/live-79404511--dd52fba5b7e0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-welcomes-china-s-xi-for-high-stakes-summit/live-79404511?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump welcomed Xi Jinping to the US by greeting him personally on the tarmac at Joint Base Andrews. The two are expected to discuss trade, AI, Taiwan and Iran during a three-day state visit.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Berlin Airport briefly suspends flights over drone sighting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c854cca8bfedf6bc86cb4baf15b952c12233d3efd0482145c5d8876832c63fee</id><updated>2026-09-24T05:04:58Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T19:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/berlin-airport-briefly-suspends-flights-over-drone-sighting/a-79403865--84b3e93d15cb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/berlin-airport-briefly-suspends-flights-over-drone-sighting/a-79403865?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Airspace over the German capital was closed for about 45 minutes after a drone was spotted on the runway. Flights have resumed but are experiencing delays.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Harvey Weinstein resentenced to 15 years for sexual assault</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:af71bcf750b46b5c8c6e295e932fe196af22f8f1ad904b475a9267847ea5931b</id><updated>2026-09-24T05:03:51Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T17:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/harvey-weinstein-resentenced-to-15-years-for-sexual-assault/a-79403381--8507b6a2aba6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/harvey-weinstein-resentenced-to-15-years-for-sexual-assault/a-79403381?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The disgraced Hollywood mogul was found guilty of sexually assaulting former production assistant Miriam Haley. The man whose case spurred the #MeToo movement awaits a separate sentencing in a California rape case.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Eviction of 87-year-old woman sparks housing protests in Madrid</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f1e6d5ed47cfc9d24157fc4785f80b47574e58801a3aa3da2f442163420d8be2</id><updated>2026-09-24T05:03:51Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T16:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eviction-of-87-year-old-woman-sparks-housing-protests-in-madrid/a-79399342--1588b5df3843.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eviction-of-87-year-old-woman-sparks-housing-protests-in-madrid/a-79399342?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Police escorted Maricarmen Abascal from the apartment she had called home for more than seven decades. The case has reignited debate over Spain's housing crisis, rising rents and protections for long-term tenants.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump's Board of Peace proposes $2.45B for reconstruction in Gaza</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e3c65842efdad6f27c7babe57ab07f5e7baf04c96bc10a1982232b344fde415a</id><updated>2026-09-24T05:03:51Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T16:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-s-board-of-peace-proposes-2-45b-for-reconstruction-in-gaza/a-79401612--59213d247592.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-s-board-of-peace-proposes-2-45b-for-reconstruction-in-gaza/a-79401612?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The board has noted that the Palestinian enclave needs roughly $35.2 billion for full, medium-term reconstruction. Trump's plan for peace in Gaza has largely stalled since an agreement was reached almost a year ago.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Who is skipping the UN General Assembly — and why</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8647b2966b00d4d2171e10e15f60ee78ae70795bc90f2f13de40404e14546075</id><updated>2026-09-24T05:03:51Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T15:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/who-is-skipping-the-un-general-assembly-and-why/a-79391652--2b8efddbdd7a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/who-is-skipping-the-un-general-assembly-and-why/a-79391652?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Xi Jinping, Vladimir Putin, Friedrich Merz, Giorgia Meloni and Mahmoud Abbas are among more than 50 leaders who won't make it to the UN General Assembly. Their reasons range from illness and domestic affairs to holidays.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Could a Left Party government in Berlin expropriate large real estate companies?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ed3c820c192932153e696269e08f6890ddb59b44c98f1ad8606052ecd17c47eb</id><updated>2026-09-24T05:03:51Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T14:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/could-a-left-party-government-in-berlin-expropriate-large-real-estate-companies/a-79399683--c9f46d7db0c4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/could-a-left-party-government-in-berlin-expropriate-large-real-estate-companies/a-79399683?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The socialist Left Party won the Berlin election partly on the promise to implement the city's 2021 expropriation referendum as a way to solve the city's rent crisis. But can it really happen?</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>China's 13-year-old swimming star raises questions on child athletes</title><id>urn:rssync:en